Package: cockpit-networkd
Version: VERSION
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: cockpit-bridge, systemd, iproute2
Maintainer: MAINTAINER
Installed-Size: INSTALLED_SIZE
Homepage: https://github.com/sammiq/cockpit-networkd
Description: Cockpit networking page for systemd-networkd
 Shows network interfaces managed by systemd-networkd in the Cockpit web
 console: transmit and receive graphs, interfaces with their addresses,
 state, routes and DNS, bond and bridge ports, and networkd's logs.
 Read-only. For hosts that use systemd-networkd instead of NetworkManager.
